---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import CartDrawer from '../components/CartDrawer.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Pricing, Refund, Shipping & GST Policy | AKS Aeromodels</title>
</head>
<body class="bellavita-page-body">
  <Header />
  <main class="container page-padding reveal-on-scroll">
    <div class="policy-box">
      <h1 class="policy-title">PRICING, REFUND & GST POLICY</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: August 2026</p>
      
      <section class="policy-section">
        <h2 class="policy-heading">1. Transparent Pricing & 18% GST Credit</h2>
        <p>All prices listed on AKS Aeromodels are inclusive of applicable Goods and Services Tax (GST). B2B Tax Invoices with GSTIN input credit details are generated automatically for corporate, lab, and engineering college orders.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h2 class="policy-heading">2. Express Shipping & Transit Damage Guarantee</h2>
        <p>Orders are dispatched within 24 hours from Devlali Camp, Nashik. All shipments are 100% insured against courier transit damage. If any balsa sheet or airframe arrives damaged, notify us on WhatsApp within 24 hours with an unboxing video for instant free replacement.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h2 class="policy-heading">3. Refund & Replacement Policy</h2>
        <p>Unopened items in original factory packaging can be returned within 7 days of delivery for a full refund or exchange. Defective engines or radio receivers are inspected by our technical team for immediate replacement.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <CartDrawer />
  <Footer />

  <style>
    :global(body.bellavita-page-body) {
      background-color: #fbf9f5 !important;
      color: #1a1a1a !important;
    }
    .page-padding { padding: 4rem 1.25rem 6rem; }
    .policy-box {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e6e0d5;
      padding: 3rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #333333;
    }
    .policy-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      color: #3b0811;
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }
    .updated { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #888888; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .policy-section { margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
    .policy-heading {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      color: #1a1a1a;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e0d5;
      padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }
    .policy-section p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: #555555; }
  </style>
</body>
</html>
